# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Opens the necro hotbar when it is missing, looked for every 30 seconds.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ wait
#
#   interval__hotbar_check
#      How often the hotbar is looked for, and so how long a lost one waits. It only
#      closes on a death, a relog or a stray click, and while it is closed every ability
#      parks.
#
#   wait__hotbar_gump
#      How long the hotbar gump may take to open.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@setvar! interval__hotbar_check 30000
@setvar! wait__hotbar_gump 1000


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ timer
#
#   timer__hotbar_check
#      Ready on the first pass, so the hotbar is opened at once when it is missing.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
timer__hotbar_check interval__hotbar_check


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ loop
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # NECRO HOTBAR
    #
    # The hotbar gump is the source of truth for the Unholy Symbol count the necro stage
    # reads. One block covers both the first open and any later loss, because the timer
    # starts expired. It is looked for every thirty seconds, the clock leading because
    # skipping the gump lookup is the point. The clock only restarts once it has looked,
    # so a missing hotbar behind an open cursor is tried again on the next pass.
    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    if timer "timer__hotbar_check" >= interval__hotbar_check
        if skill "Necromancy" > 0 and not gumpexists 622436516
            if not targetexists and not casting
                settimer "timer__hotbar_check" 0

                if findtype 'necromancer book' backpack
                    yell '[necromancyhotbar'
                    waitforgump 622436516 wait__hotbar_gump
                elseif timer "timer__message" >= interval__message
                    overhead "[ necro book, out ]" 254
                    settimer "timer__message" 0
                endif
            endif
        else
            settimer "timer__hotbar_check" 0
        endif
    endif
